  </section>

  <section class="qa-sources qa-section" aria-labelledby="src-h2">
    <h2 id="src-h2">Sources</h2>
    <ol class="qa-src-list">
      <li id="src-1">Boarman, W.I. & Heinrich, B. (1999). Common Raven (<em>Corvus corax</em>). In <em>Birds of the World</em>. Cornell Lab. — pair bonding, territory, breeding biology.</li>
      <li id="src-2">Heinrich, B. (1999). <em>Mind of the Raven</em>. HarperCollins. — long-term field observations of pair bonds in wild ravens.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="qa-claim-note"><strong class="claim-science">[science]</strong> peer-reviewed study or field-guide data</p>
  </section>

